# QA Reporting Rules

When testing is finished:

Create a QA report.

Do not fix any bugs.

Store all reports inside:

QA-Reports/

Each test run should create a new folder with date.

Example:

QA-Reports/
  YYYY-MM-DD-test-name/


The report must contain:

## Bug Information

For every issue:

- Bug ID
- Title
- Severity
- Page URL
- Steps to reproduce
- Expected result
- Actual result
- Screenshot path
- Console errors
- Network errors
- Possible cause


Save files:

report.md
bugs.txt


For visual issues:

Take screenshots and save them inside:

screenshots/


For failed flows:

Record video if possible.
